<title>ITALY: Espresso agrees Repubblica merger.</title>
<headline>Espresso agrees Repubblica merger.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian press publisher L'Espresso said on Monday its sales of advertising in the first four months of 1997 rose 19 percent, and added that its shareholders agreed a previously announced merger with fellow publishing group La Repubblica.</p>
<p>The sales figure was given at an Espresso shareholders meeting which approved its 1996 accounts and agreed the merger with La Repubblica.</p>
<p>Both weekly magazine Espresso and daily newspaper La Repubblica are controlled by Carlo De Benedetti's industrial holding company CIR.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
